===Etymology===
From {{bor|de|gml|mēwe}}, {{m|gml|mēve}}, from {{der|de|gem-pro|*maiwaz}}. Cognate with {{cog|nds-de|Mööv}}, {{m|nds-de|Meev}}, {{cog|nl|meeuw}}, {{cog|ang|mǣw}}, {{cog|non|már}}.

